patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/project/updateStatus/{{projectId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  # Toggle Published

  Admin only. Flips `status` between `draft` and `published` — no body, the
  server reads the current value and inverts it in a single pipeline update.

  This is the real publish gate. **Toggle Homepage** is only a display flag: a
  draft stays off the site even with `showOnHomepage: true`.

  `message` says which way it went, so the dashboard can show it verbatim.

  | Status | Meaning |
  | --- | --- |
  | 200 | flipped; `data.status` is the new value |
  | 401 | missing or expired token |
  | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` |
}
